recipes[9|]{task|steps}:
After any tag change|python tools/concordia/deckgen/pool.py; python tools/concordia/deckgen/tag_run.py run; python tools/concordia/deckgen/tagcheck/mtg2llm.py (gap check); update log-code-analyses.toon row
Add a tag family|code in tag_extra.py + DOC row; constants in tag_reports.py; list as PROPOSED in NEW_TAGS_FOR_APPROVAL.md; implement only after the user marks it; move to APPROVED_DECISION; re-run gap check
Clear mtg2llm gaps|apply open rows of tags/MTG2LLM_GAPS.toon; hand lines go in tagcheck/hand_units.json (pattern -> Oracle-accurate line); check new tags re-keyed patterns
Rebuild starters|starter_build.py steps (commander, build, review-export, review-apply); output staging_starters; no live copy
Score a deck|python tools/concordia/power_scorer.py DECK.dck
Run sims|tools/concordia/suite/README.md
Look up a rule/keyword/card|tools/agents/lookup.py cr|kw|tag|rule|card
Push|only on the user's "push": git pull --no-rebase origin campaign-design; git push origin HEAD:campaign-design; report real output. Documents: docpush.py
End of session|HANDOVER.md update, sync_check.py manifest, commit, push on "push" (skill session-commit)

